UID:2026-10-19-elc-primary-curriculum-night@enishi.ac.jp
DTSTAMP:20261009T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261019T173000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261019T203000
SUMMARY:ELC & Primary Curriculum Night
DESCRIPTION:An evening to help families understand what children learn\, 
 how they learn\, how progress is assessed\, and how learning can be supp
 orted at home. Families will experience classroom activities\, explore t
 opics of interest\, and ask questions. The evening begins with a welcome
  in the Community Room\, followed by two breakout sessions and a panel Q
 &A. Please complete the attendance and session selection form\; sessions
  with limited interest may be cancelled.\n\nFor: Primary\, ELC (parents 
 invited)\nhttps://enishi.ac.jp/EISCompass.html#/event/2026-10-19-elc-pri
 mary-curriculum-night
LOCATION:Community Room
URL:https://enishi.ac.jp/EISCompass.html#/event/2026-10-19-elc-primary-cu
 rriculum-night
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
